        "description": "Universal is building it\u2019s first ever European theme park in... Bedford?  \n \nIn this video we explore what happens when a global entertainment giant decides to build a billion-pound resort in a quiet English town.\n \nWe look into why they chose Bedford, what\u2019s been confirmed so far, and how this development could change the South East of England forever. Will you be visiting? Let us know in the comments!  \n \nIn this video...  \n \n00:00 - Universal\u2026.Bedford  \n00:38 - Why Bedford?  \n02:01 - How big is it going to be?  \n02:42 - Site visit with Digital Dan  \n04:31 - The rides\u2026 as far as we know!  \n06:18 - The downsides: property, prices and poo \n08:01 - What do the locals think?  \n10:21 - The benefits: tourism, transport and a world-class theme park  \n10:59 - Is Bedford the next Orlando?  \n12:46 - Is the South East of England becoming a theme park hub?  \n \nSubscribe to our channel here: bbc.in/bbcnews  \n \nFor the latest news download the BBC News app or visit https://BBC.com/news  \n \n#BBCNe",
