        "description": "The team behind Dispatch didn\u2019t just navigate the challenges of making and releasing a narrative game - they also had to respond to an unexpectedly passionate fandom. \n \nAhead of the Bafta Games Awards, BBC\u2019s Mel Ramsay sat down with Dennis Lennart and Nick Herman, co\u2011creative directors at AdHoc Studio. They spoke about how the fandom shaped their thinking, what they learned from community response and how that experience is influencing the future of the studio and its projects.\n\nSubscribe to our channel here: https://bbc.in/bbcnews\n\nFor the latest news download the BBC News app or visit BBC.com/news\n \n#Dispatch #DispatchGame #AlanahPearce #AdHodStudio #Moistcr1tikal #Penguinz0 #Jacksepticeye #Fandom #BBCGaming #BBCNews",
